# Committed local defaults for repository tooling.
#
# Only repository tooling reads this file: the development runner, the browser
# journey, the Vite build, and CDK synthesis. The runtime configuration loaders
# never read it, so a deployed Lambda missing its variables still fails closed.
#
# It may contain only values that are safe to be wrong and safe to be public.
# Never put a credential here. Real values belong in `.env`, which is ignored.
# Anything already set in the environment wins over these defaults.

TTR_ENV=local
VITE_TTR_ENV=local
